        "tile2_body": "<p>Vegan. No animal testing. 100% plant-based. Every ingredient is clean, certified organic, and chosen because it belongs in a living ecosystem, not because it’s cheap or convenient.</p>",
        "tile2_bg": "#e9f1e4",
        "image2": "shopify://shop_images/Background_Border_3.png",
