        "tile3_icon": "🔬",
        "tile3_title": "Science + Nature",
        "tile3_body": "<p>Your mouth is an ecosystem. Science has finally caught up to the powerful but often overlooked ecology inside you. A network of beneficial microbes lives in your mouth, quietly working to maintain optimal oral health. They need food. Rainbow Smile gives it to them.</p>",
        "tile3_bg": "#f5f1e9",
        "image3": "shopify://shop_images/Background_Border_4.png",
