        "image_alt": "William Robertson, founder of Rainbow Smile",
        "eyebrow": "About the Founder",
        "title_before": "Hi, I'm",
        "title_script": "William",
        "body": "<p>Founder of Rainbow Smile, a company born from a deep passion for wellness, the wisdom of nature, and the belief that true health begins within the small but mighty ecosystem living inside each of us.</p><p>Rainbow Smile is more than just a line of products, it's a movement. A movement toward reconnecting with nature, reclaiming vibrant, whole-body health, and embracing joy-filled, authentic smiles as symbols of genuine wellness.</p>",
        "quote": "<p>\"Our Mission: A Planet Smiling — a planet smiling in harmony with its own living code, where every mouth becomes a messenger of peace and every smile a sign of health supported.\"</p>",
